      en: ["First historical records of the fort date to the 4th century AD", "The famous terracotta icons were discovered in 1985", "The site is located at an altitude of 400 meters above sea level", "Total area of the archaeological site is 2.5 hectares", "Icons depict scenes from the Old and New Testaments", "Discovery included over 26 complete or fragmented reliefs"],
